spirv-tools: spirv-tools (SPIR-V module processing)
spirv-tools:
spirv-tools: The SPIR-V Tools project provides an API and commands for processing
spirv-tools: SPIR-V modules.
spirv-tools: The project includes an assembler, binary module parser,
spirv-tools: disassembler, validator, and optimizer for SPIR-V. Except for the
spirv-tools: optimizer, all are based on a common static library. The library
spirv-tools: contains all of the implementation details, and is used in the
spirv-tools: standalone tools whilst also enabling integration into other code
spirv-tools: bases directly. The optimizer implementation resides in its own
spirv-tools: library, which depends on the core library.
